  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Bangladesh Economic Engagement Program (BEEP) Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Bangladesh Economic Engagement Program (BEEP) Fund investment will provide funding to deliver technical assistance and policy support for targeted economic reforms and institutional strengthening.  The BEEP Fund forms part of Australia&apos;s overarching support for Bangladesh&apos;s economic development in alignment with the objectives of economic recovery and inclusive growth. Activities under the BEEP Fund investment will primarily be implemented by multilateral financial institutions, but may include other partners such as Australian Government Departments or other regional institutions.</narrative>
  </description>
